  "prefLabel": "Res 5303.02 Scale Slip",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5303.02 Scale Slip. A scale slip shall contain the following information:\n\n(a) Species of wood product;\n\n(b) Board footage of each individual log when standard unit of measurement is per thousand board feet or tonnage or cordage when not sold on a per thousand board feet basis;\n\n(c) Gross scale, defect and net scale;\n\n(d) Date wood was measured; and\n\n(e) Name of party scaling the wood.\n\nSource. #8441, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10547, eff 3-21-14 (from Res 5303.03)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res5200-5900.html"
